==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 3.33~11.33 seconds<sup>100f~340f</sup>.
*2 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Those Guys]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.67~7.33 seconds<sup>20f~220f</sup>.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns.
**1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

